1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,860
In an important move today, the Board of Directors announced that their search for a new CEO has been successful.

2
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:12,440
We are pleased to announce that Mr. Michael Benwick, one of the most respected business leaders in Europe, has accepted the position.

3
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:20,000
Mr. Benwick has had a far-ranging and highly successful career in industry in South Africa and the United Kingdom.

4
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:27,600
After graduating from Oxford in 1965, he took a middle management position in South Africa's mining industry.

5
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,460
From there he has never looked back.

6
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:35,540
We welcome him not only for his dynamism and charisma but also for his wealth of experience.
